  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>“Tales Beyond The Tomb”</b> is a chilling episodic horror series that immerses players in the shadows of real-life cases.<p></p>\n<p>Inspired by the gritty, atmospheric horror of the 80s and 90s, each episode simulates the frightening experiences of real people, mixing nostalgia with unrelenting suspense.</p>\n<p>Episode 1: Pineville Night Stalker – After her mother’s unexpected death, Megan receives a call about a sudden and mysterious inheritance awaiting in the desolate town of Pineville. With her work friend, Lenny – she embarks on a journey that should be simple, but quickly turns into a web of danger and deceit.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>VHS Aesthetic</b> – Step back in time with visuals inspired by classic horror films of the ’80s and ’90s.\n</li><li><b>Photorealistic Graphics &amp; Immersive Environments</b> – Feel the dread with lifelike visuals and haunting settings.\n</li><li><b>Voice Activity</b> – Interaction system with your microphone (no microphone is needed to play, but this increases your interaction and involves a complete experience).\n</li><li><b>Dialog Text System</b> – Immerse yourself in the plot with dynamic, narrative-driven dialogues.\n</li></ul>\n",
